                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 15pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"></span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #333333;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 15pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">各位老师：</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> 绍兴市教育教学研究院决定举行绍兴中小学生学习活动成果评比，请有意愿报名的老师将相关材料的电子稿和纸质稿于</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2023年10月</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">24日前 (报名</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">综合实践活动成果</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">评比的请于</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6月</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">日</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">前) 交到教科室, </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">现将有关事项通知如下：</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一、评比项目</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1.研究性学习成果：</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">小课题研究、调查报告</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学科小论文</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2.</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">综合实践活动成果</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">：考察探究、设计制作、社会服务、职业体验及其他。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3.</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高中模拟政协</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">二、评比时间</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2023年11月</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">三、评比要求</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2023年9月前结题的个人或小组合作产生的学生成果，已在市级及以上单位举办的活动中获奖的成果不再参加评比。具体评比要求如下：</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1.</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">研究性学习和综合实践活动的学生活动成果</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">参评的材料应如实地反映学生在学习过程中，通过多种学习或实践方式(考察探究、设计制作、社会服务、职业体验、场馆学习、团队活动等)取得的成果和真实体验，内容丰富，思路清晰。</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">其中综合实践活动</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">征集的成果</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">特指</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学校和教师根据教育部2017 年版《中小学综合实践活动课程指导纲要》中综合实践活动课程的目标、内容、方式，组织开展课程活动过程中指导学生形成的相关成果</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，倡导注重跨学科研究性学习和社会实践。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2.</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">研究性学习成果中小课题研究</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">和</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">调查报告撰写</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的要素包括</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">：研究（调查）的背景与意义、过程与方法、结果与分析、结论与讨论四个部分</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；小论文格式自拟。综合实践活动</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学生成果报告由题目、摘要、正文、参考文献构成</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">其中正文包含背景与意义、过程与方法、结果与分析、结论与讨论四个部分</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">成果报告中需要体现对活动过程和结果的系统梳理和有效反思。成果报告格式可参考省编教学用书与教师用书中的学生成果报告样例。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3.</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">成果的作者应是学生</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">可以是个人成果，也可以是集体成果。集体成果署名不多于6个</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">指导老师不超过2个。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4.</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">成果以文字说明为主，适当配以图片和图示。成果应简洁明了，注意控制字数。</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">其中研究性学习成果</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">小学、初中3000字以内，高中5000字以内</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；综合实践活动成果8000字内。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5.</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">成果附件：</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">上报成果时，应将</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">研</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">究记录、反思日志</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">实践过程照片、有关视频</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">等</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">文本</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">和</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">相关实物作品照片作为附件一起打包递交。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6.</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">上报的成果请在封面左上角注明类别。</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">采用“学段+类型+类别”的方式，</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">如</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">小学—</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">研究性学习</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">—小课题</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”、“初中—综合实践活动—设计制作”等</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。 </span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">四、体例格式</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1．封面标明课题名称、研究时间、学校、班级、指导老师（联系方式）、作者或小组成员。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2．内容正文用小四号宋体，标题用小三号黑体；行间距为固定值22磅。采用Word文档，A4纸，页边距设置上、下为2.54cm,左、右为2.2cm。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3．附件是帮助评委了解研究过程的真实性、科学性以及成果</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的一些原始文字材料，附件总页数一般情况控制在A4纸10页以内。</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">其中综合实践</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">成果附件不超过1000</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">0</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">字。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">五、报送数量及要求</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 30.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1．区、县（市）报送上限</span></p><table style="border: none;border-collapse: collapse;margin-bottom: .001pt;"><tbody><tr style="height: 0.23in;" class="firstRow"><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.5pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 51.5pt;"><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>区、县（市）</strong></span></p></td><td colspan="3" style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.5pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 126.75pt;"><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size